Description: Notch AI usage widget for Ubuntu GNOME and Wayland
 Independent Linux port maintained by B. Gray, originally derived from
 vinzdg/codenotch, plus a settings divider,
 AI selection, per-provider verification, usage tooltips,
 read-only credential discovery, and native GNOME/Wayland integration.
 Adds clock, date, weather, battery, and system-resource widgets, spring
 animations, an optional resting sliver, and Pango-rendered text. Protocol-enabled
 Wayland compositors use their negotiated panel protocol and unsupported
 compositors exit safely.

